  <section class="sec__intro">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-12">
          <h2 class="heading--big text--center">Explore Patagonia Argentina</h2>
          <h3 class="heading--small text--center" id="sub_index_pr">15 YEARS GUIDING IN PATAGONIA</h3>
          <img class="separador" src="/imagenes/body/separador.png" alt="separador" />
          <p class="text--grey text--center">
            Imagine waking up at a wilderness camp to the sounds of a Patagonia river, a crackling fire, and the scent of fresh brewed coffee and a hearty breakfast of with fresh eggs cooking over hot coals under the canopy of a wild blue Patagonia sky. Following breakfast, your guides have packed your drift boat with the provisions for the day and you set off for a full day of fly fishing – every bend in the river unveiling the magnificent beauty that is Patagonia. After a full day on the water, you arrive at your lodge or camp to a warm fire, appetizers and beverages, and a tasty Patagonia meal prepared by your camp or lodge Chef. When camping, your camp will be complete with kitchen tent, bar and dining tents and sleeping tents, comfortable chairs and tables with all the comforts of home, set up and awaiting your arrival.
          </p>
          <p class="text--grey text--center">
            Every trip we offer is custom-designed to provide you the absolute best fly-fishing experience possible based on your ideas and budget! We provide lodging, meals, transportation, guides, gear, and everything you could possibly need for an amazing adventure! We've got something amazing and custom for you.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

